' A program whose name doesn't fit Studio's status bar (tests/studio_flows.mjs
' debug-status-long-name): stopped at line 5, the bar says where — the
' name shortened in its middle, the line kept, the whole in its tooltip.
DIM total AS INTEGER, i AS INTEGER
FOR i = 1 TO 3
  total = total + i
NEXT
PRINT "total"; total
